.TH STOP-CONTROLROOM.SH 1 "2026-10-06" "mu2edaq-controlroom-setup 1.0.0" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
stop\-controlroom.sh \- close every tunnel and stop every configured VNC session
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bin/stop\-controlroom.sh
.SH DESCRIPTION
Client\-side wrapper: exits 1 if
.I venv/bin/crs\-remote
is missing, runs
.B "crs\-tunnel close \-\-all"
(failures ignored), then
.BR "crs\-remote stop \-\-all" .
Stopping a session disconnects every operator attached to it.
.SH OPTIONS
None.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.BR "crs\-remote stop" 's
status; 1 without a venv.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
bin/stop\-controlroom.sh
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR start\-controlroom.sh (1),
.BR crs\-remote (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Mu2e DAQ group.
